  expr_unary_postfix_err_not_int.pcpp - break step of expr_unary_postfix.pcpp:
  not on an int32 (SM0250)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\expr_unary_postfix_err_not_int.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\expr_unary_postfix_err_not_int.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
